# Smart City Booking Storefront

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Key points:

- Nuxt 4 / Vue 3 public booking UI, Nitro BFF proxying v4.x backend API
- Backend → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-backend, Admin UI → github.com/ECCdigital/smart-city-booking-vue-app
- Client logic in `app/composables/`, state in `stores/`, BFF in `server/api/`
- English for code, comments, commits, PRs, and changelog entries
- User-facing text via i18n (`i18n/locales/de.json` + `en.json`)
- DRY: reuse existing composables/stores/server routes; extract only on real duplication
- Run `npm run lint:check` before finishing
- Minimal diffs, no drive-by refactors, no commits unless asked
- Never commit secrets (`.env`), never expose auth tokens to client JS

Detailed guides: `docs/agents/`
